flowchart TD
    T[Task event] --> I{Eligible?}
    I -- no --> F[Conventional scheduling]
    I -- yes --> S[Read signal and runtime state]
    S --> P[Policy lookup]
    P --> G[Controller gate]
    G --> V{Capability valid?}
    V -- no --> R[Observed-state / RUN fallback]
    V -- yes --> A[RUN / YIELD / MIGRATE / THROTTLE / SLEEP]
    A --> E[Execute and record outcome]
    R --> E
